+# saml2aws Radioisotope Detector
+
+This detector reports plaintext saml2aws password fields.
+
+saml2aws can store IdP passwords and MFA secrets in `~/.saml2aws`; that file is
+upstream-owned mutable configuration, so this radioisotope is detect-only.
+
+Automic Vault does not migrate saml2aws config yet.
